<main class="page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="faint">Last updated: September 14, 2026</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Coursework stores the information needed to run the platform: your name, email address, password (as a salted hash, never in plain text), role, course enrollments, and any materials, assignments, or submissions you create or upload.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>Account data is used only to authenticate you, show you the courses you are enrolled in or teach, and let faculty track assignment completion. We do not sell data or share it with advertisers.</p>

    <h2>File uploads</h2>
    <p>Files submitted for assignments are stored on the server and are accessible to the course's faculty and the student who submitted them.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>Account and coursework data is retained for as long as your account is active. You can request deletion of your account and associated data by contacting an administrator.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be directed to your institution's system administrator.</p>
  </div>
</main>
